{"title":"What should I ask David Brooks?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/920400335/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-David-Brooks.html","date":1750256290000,"content":"<p>Yes, I will be doing a Conversation with him, this time <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.92ny.org/event/conversations-with-tyler-david-brooks\" target=\"_blank\">at the 92nd St. Y in NYC</a>.</p>\r\n<p>You may recall I have <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://conversationswithtyler.com/episodes/david-brooks/\" target=\"_blank\">an earlier CWT with David</a>, held at GMU in 2018.</p>\r\n<p>So what should I ask him?  Please keep in mind that I wish to avoid most issues connected to current political debates.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/what-should-i-ask-david-brooks.html\">What should I ask David Brooks?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/920400335/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/920400335/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/920400335/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/920400335/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/920400335/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/920400335/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png